---
import ResponsiveImage from '../ResponsiveImage.astro';
// ClassFlow.astro - Redesigned based on fuckfuck.html with Orange theme
---

<section class="section classflow" id="classflow">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head motion-up">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">03 / Step Flow</p>
        <h2>クラスの流れ</h2>
      </div>
      <span class="section-index" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
    </div>

    <div class="flow-grid">
      <article class="flow-card motion-up" data-motion-delay="0.0">
        <div class="flow-image">
          <ResponsiveImage name="flow1" width={1200} height={800} sizes="(max-width:860px) calc(100vw - 74px), 360px" alt="柔術クラスの流れ STEP1 準備体操・受身・マット運動" />
          <span class="flow-step">STEP 01</span>
        </div>
        <h3>準備・マット運動</h3>
        <p>「受け身」「エビ」など怪我を予防し、寝技に直結する基本動作を練習。未経験でも無理なく身体のバランス感覚を養えます。</p>
      </article>

      <article class="flow-card motion-up" data-motion-delay="0.15">
        <div class="flow-image">
          <ResponsiveImage name="flow2" width={1200} height={800} sizes="(max-width:860px) calc(100vw - 74px), 360px" alt="柔術クラスの流れ STEP2 テクニック解説とペアでの反復練習" />
          <span class="flow-step">STEP 02</span>
        </div>
        <h3>テクニック練習</h3>
        <p>インストラクターの解説を見た後、2人1組で反復。先輩メンバーも優しくフォローするので初心者も安心して学べます。</p>
      </article>

      <article class="flow-card motion-up" data-motion-delay="0.3">
        <div class="flow-image">
          <ResponsiveImage name="flow3" width={1200} height={800} sizes="(max-width:860px) calc(100vw - 74px), 360px" alt="柔術クラスの流れ STEP3 初心者も安心の実践スパーリング練習" />
          <span class="flow-step">STEP 03</span>
        </div>
        <h3>実践スパーリング</h3>
        <p>学んだ技を試す実践練習。力任せではなく技の駆け引きが楽しく、初心者のうちは相手が手加減して動きを合わせてくれます。</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .classflow {
    padding-block: 108px;
    background: #f4f4ee;
    color: #141613;
    font-family: 'Noto Sans JP', sans-serif;
  }

  .wrap {
    width: min(1220px, calc(100% - 48px));
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    font-family: 'Oswald', Impact, sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #ff6b00;
  }

  .eyebrow::before {
    content: "";
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    background: currentColor;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .section-head {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-end;
    gap: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 44px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #141613;
    padding-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .section-head h2 {
    margin: 8px 0 0;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 3.8vw, 44px);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .section-index {
    color: #a2a799;
    font-family: 'Oswald', Impact, sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(48px, 6vw, 76px);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 0.85;
  }

  .flow-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .flow-card {
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid #dbded3;
    padding: 20px;
  }

  .flow-image {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    aspect-ratio: 1.4;
    background: #e2e5dc;
  }

  .flow-image img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }

  .flow-step {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    background: #ff6b00;
    color: #ffffff;
    padding: 6px 14px;
    font-family: 'Oswald', Impact, sans-serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .flow-card h3 {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin: 18px 0 10px;
    color: #141613;
  }

  .flow-card p {
    color: #666a61;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .classflow {
      padding-block: 72px;
    }
    .wrap {
      width: calc(100% - 32px);
    }
    .flow-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
